paragraph","text":"ちっちゃい紙に細かい絵を描いたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"図工すきです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/03/6490685/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれ？まりかって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"爬虫類平気な人だっけ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/03/6490685/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"平気というかすき"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/03/6490685/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トカゲとかヤモリとか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上から見た形がすきで、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"顔もすきです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヤモリの手足は特にすきです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ワニもすき。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/03/6490685/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"我が家は調整豆乳ですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかは調整？それとも無調整？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/03/6490685/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"調整は甘いのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が買ってるのは甘くないから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無調整ですたぶん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きな粉味とか黒ごま味の調整豆乳も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飲む時ありますっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/03/6490685/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば朝走るって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いうのはまだ続けてるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/03/6490685/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前走ったら筋肉痛に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なったので、控えてましたが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今は朝起きれたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと走ってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/03/6490685/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/03/6490685/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝スムっていつからやってんの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/03/6490685/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けっこう前から。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いちご豆乳にはまったのがきっかけで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分で作って飲むようになったかな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/03/6490685/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな豆乳飲んでるけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな効果があるの？(?_?)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/03/6490685/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イソフラボンが肌に良いって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聞くし、体に良いと勝手に思って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飲んでます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/03/6490685/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/03/6490685/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「美人だね」と「かわいいね」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっちがうれしい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/03/6490685/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そりゃどっちも嬉しい><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっちも思ってもらえるように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分磨きだあぁ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/03/6490685/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『今までコメントした人が最"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"近コメント来ないなぁ』て"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感じたことある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/03/6490685/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/03/6490685/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"***********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テストが近くなってきたので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勉強しなきゃやー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/03/6490685/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あうあうあう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/03/6490685/0022.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}}